830Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"**Analyzing cold cache disk I/O bottleneck**\n**Designing sequential read with parallel hashing**\n**Planning sequential read with staggered workers**\n**Planning sequential read validation test**\n**Designing chunked hashing pipeline**\n**Preparing regression test infrastructure**\n**Designing package-private chunk hashing method**\n**Implementing worker-bounded chunk reading and testing**\n**Considering early failure on hash mismatch**\n**Planning test for worker adjustment**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_03d70cda469f9300016a9f4cf4b9bc87d0b035ebeb7f5ff535","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"62bb6421-2fdd-417d-aec9-13ca339a4bdd","seq":2304,"startedSeq":1995,"endedSeq":2304,"timestamp":"1788824878Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"证据现在足以判定根因：在主动驱逐该 2 GiB 对象的 page cache 后，单次 Host ready 为 **12,244 ms**，其中 JVM/JFR 进入约 0.96 秒、SQLite 0.615 秒、Artifact state 0.038 秒、完整 Artifact 校验 **7.629 秒**、bind+locator 0.128 秒；JFR 记录对该对象读取约 1.8 GiB（录制窗口内）且 CPU 热点为 SHA-256。当前 8 个 worker 同时从 8 个相距 64 MiB 的 range 读取，导致冷盘多路交错；热缓存时同一校验只需约 1.5–2.8 秒，因此完整解释了 8.238 秒首样本与后续约 3.5 秒的差异。\n\n确定修复方向不是改 worker 数量，而是保持 8 worker、64 MiB digest 索引和完整逐字节 SHA-256，将 I/O ownership 改为**单一顺序 reader + 最多 8 个有界 heap chunk 交给 8 个 digest worker**。这消除冷盘交错，同时让磁盘读取与 SHA-256 CPU 重叠；不引入 mtime/size 捷径、异步 ready 或弱化校验。现在先加入该管线合同的最小失败测试并保存红灯证据。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_qz8BLjOmP1biuu7uP3hoMRCb","kind":"toolCall","title":"Edit ji-java\\adapters\\ji-artifact-filesystem\\src\\test\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\artifact\\fs\\HashingTest.java","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_qz8BLjOmP1biuu7uP3hoMRCb","sessionId":"62bb6421-2fdd-417d-aec9-13ca339a4bdd","seq":2311,"startedSeq":2305,"endedSeq":2311,"timestamp":"1788824891Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Edit","toolDetailAvailabl